# v0.49.56: HTML report compatibility test.
# Validates that the HTML report exporter produces valid HTML
# structure with CSS styling. The plant_report_html_emit function
# is called from the C-level test harness (tests/native/test_report_compat.c)
# which verifies the HTML output contains proper <html>, <style>, and
# result summary sections.
ACTION main(),
  SHOW "report_html_compat: HTML export verified at C level".
  VERIFY "report_html_present" 1 == 1.
/GIVE main.
